1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,680
Bu yetmish foizlik chegirma

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:04,640
yetmish foiz emas.

3
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:07,010
To'lashdan oldin hisoblang.

4
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:08,760
Usta, qarang! Uch yuz ming edi,

5
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:09,910
bir yuz yetmish ming bo'libdi!

6
00:00:09,910 --> 00:00:11,210
Hozir olmasam, yutqazaman!

7
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:14,010
Bu narsani chegirmani ko'rishdan oldin

8
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:15,440
ham qidirayotgan edingmi?

9
00:00:16,190 --> 00:00:17,090
Yo'q...

10
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:20,220
Chegirmani ko'rib qoldim.

11
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:21,350
Hisoblaylik.

12
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:24,640
Uch yuz mingdan bir yuz o'ttiz ming tushgan.

13
00:00:25,310 --> 00:00:26,780
Bu yetmish emas,

14
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:28,330
qirq uch foiz.

15
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:32,110
Unda nega yetmish deb yozishgan?

16
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:34,170
Katta raqam ko'zni,

17
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:36,570
taymer qo'lni shoshiltiradi.

18
00:00:37,170 --> 00:00:40,000
Kerakli narsa shoshilishni talab qilmaydi.

19
00:00:40,450 --> 00:00:41,200
Uchta tekshiruv.

20
00:00:41,890 --> 00:00:43,620
Boshqa do'kondagi narxi qancha?

21
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:46,650
O'lchami, sifati, kafolati bir xilmi?

22
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:49,890
Va shu mahsulot senga kecha ham kerakmidi?

23
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:52,220
Demak, avval hisoblayman,

24
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:53,450
keyin olaman.

25
00:00:58,450 --> 00:00:59,310
Hoy-hoy, Diyor!

26
00:00:59,310 --> 00:01:01,880
Sen do'konda chegirma qidiryapsanmi

27
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:03,380
yoki ko'chada kelin?

28
00:01:03,550 --> 00:01:06,200
Yo'q, usta... men... hisoblayapman!

29
00:01:06,450 --> 00:01:08,220
Ko'zing narxda bo'lsin, ukam.

30
00:01:08,780 --> 00:01:10,750
Avval hisob, keyin kelin!

31
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:13,110
Xaridni foiz emas,

32
00:01:13,530 --> 00:01:14,790
ehtiyoj hal qilsin.

33
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:17,690
Chegirma yorlig'ini suratga olib

34
00:01:17,950 --> 00:01:18,960
botimizga yuboring:

35
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:19,680
@sahiychishopbot

36
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:20,970
Haqiqiy foizni hisoblab,

37
00:01:20,970 --> 00:01:22,700
nimani tekshirishni aytib beradi.

